  "scope": [
    "Distinct pure persistLoginInfo operation reuses the bounded credentials request and existing stored/cleared/executed DTO; no getLoginJs/prelude/login()/UI callback evaluation.",
    "Existing original source environment and checked source.login-info LoginManager owner mutation; empty working Map removes raw info, headers stay owned independently; rejected put is not ACK, removal rejection/IO/cancel are errors.",
    "Same source actor/gate, after-wait resolver admission checks source UUID/URL/signature and existing revision acceptance; owner revocation/close, primary and secondary errors and independent MayCommit/Committed facts retained.",
    "Original UI returns semantic workingMapChanged only for select/toggle missing-or-empty construction; Form keeps dynamic metadata, actual user select/toggle/callback dirty and failed dynamic rerender semantics.",
    "Sticky accepted OK blocks later non-OK autosave through login failure/cancel; close persists working Map only, never text-control overlay or hidden-key-dropping legacy projection.",
    "Visible Close/swipe uses one owned cancellation/drain task and waits checked ACK; rejected/error keeps visible form/dirty. Forced disappearance shares frozen task and existing BackgroundTaskHold, never falsely ACKs or creates a credential cache."
  ],
